  "description": "Hyunseung Min earned his reputation as a genius composer through hard work and raw talent. All it cost him…was his family. After his father passed and his sister declared she never wanted to see him again, Hyunseung died mysteriously only to find himself back in his teenage body—before he began his career and before his father died. This time, he'll use his skills to support the family he took for granted in his previous life and show them just how much he loves them. \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
